# The dev engine's package set: every beneficial candidate applied together, one tree, one image.
#
# The dev arm is the UNION of what has measured well. A package that won is not left on a branch while the dev tree
# runs without it: five beneficial patches in five places test nothing about their combination, and the combination is
# what ships.
#
# THE ORDER BELOW IS THE APPLICATION ORDER, and it is the order the packages were cut in (git's first commit of each
# RECORD.md): each was cut against the state left by the ones before it, so applying them in any other order conflicts
# in environment.zig, cuda.zig and cuda_follow.zig, which every one of them edits.
#
# Every directory under patches/ (except engine) is either listed below or named in the EXCLUDED block with the verdict
# that keeps it out. scripts/check-dev-packages.py fails on a package that is in neither place, on a listed package that
# does not exist, and on an exclusion without a verdict.
pr1411
cache-salt
learn-starts
solo-cuts
disk-any-position
restore-held
port-multi-fill

# EXCLUDED, with the record that keeps each one out:
#   port-hc-dec      a trade: -1.96 -1.00 +1.37 +5.79 -11.72 percent at 1, 2, 4, 6 and 8 clients (queue122)
#   port-latent-tile rejected: -4.24 percent; not to be revisited without a new mechanism
#   port-prompt-many superseded by port-multi-fill, which carries the same batched prompt pass
#   port-fp8-pages   unmeasured beyond step 1; it joins when a measured improvement exists

# HOW THE UNION IS BUILT (measured 2026-11-24): not by applying these in sequence.
# Every package here edits zig/src/platform/environment.zig, zig/src/families/glm/cuda.zig and
# zig/src/families/glm/cuda_follow.zig, and three of them also cuda_lanes.zig / cuda_engine.zig, so each patch applies
# to the engine series alone and refuses on top of its neighbours ("does not apply: 0001-glm-multifill.patch" with the
# tree at 0e85a179). The union is therefore a REBASE job: pick the lightest package first, port the next one's hunks onto
# it in the same files, and gate each rung. The image that carries all of them was composed that way by hand; a script
# that applies this list in order does not reproduce it, and the list's order is a record of priority, not of application.
